# ============================================
# === Variables REQUERIDAS para producción ===
# ============================================

# === App ===
# URL pública de tu deploy (sin trailing slash, con https://).
# Se usa para construir:
#   - Links de email (signup confirmation, password reset, invites)
#   - redirect_uri de OAuth (Meta login, password recovery)
#   - Callback de webhooks
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://wechat.tu-dominio.com

# === Supabase ===
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxxx.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...

# === Cifrado (32 bytes base64) ===
# Generar: openssl rand -base64 32
# Se usa para encriptar tokens de Meta/IG/FB antes de guardar en DB.
ENCRYPTION_KEY=<base64-de-32-bytes>

# === Meta (WhatsApp Business + Facebook + Instagram) ===
META_APP_ID=842680622240701
META_APP_SECRET=<secret-real>
NEXT_PUBLIC_META_APP_ID=842680622240701
# Opcional: solo si usas Embedded Signup v4
NEXT_PUBLIC_META_CONFIG_ID=
# Si está vacío se auto-deriva: ${NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/oauth/meta/callback
NEXT_PUBLIC_META_REDIRECT_URI=

# Token que Meta envía al verificar webhooks (cualquier string aleatorio)
META_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN=<string-que-tu-elijas>

# ============================================
# === Variables OPCIONALES ===
# ============================================

# Protege los endpoints de cron (Vercel Cron manda este header).
# Generar: openssl rand -hex 24
CRON_SECRET=<hex-24-chars>

# AI: si las pones aquí se usan como defaults, si no los usuarios las meten
# en /settings/ai (futuro).
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ============================================
# === Setup de Supabase (requerido una vez) ===
# ============================================
#
# 1. Crear proyecto en https://supabase.com
# 2. En SQL Editor, ejecutar las migrations en orden:
#    - supabase/migrations/001_init_workspaces.sql
#    - supabase/migrations/002_fix_rls.sql
#    - supabase/migrations/003_fix_recursion.sql
#    - supabase/migrations/004_channels.sql
#    - supabase/migrations/005_messaging.sql
#    - supabase/migrations/006_fix_channels_text.sql
#    - supabase/migrations/007_messages_read.sql
#    - supabase/migrations/008_messages_full_unique.sql
#    - supabase/migrations/009_messages_read.sql
#    - supabase/migrations/010_unread_count_rpc.sql
#    - supabase/migrations/011_invitations_accepted_by.sql
#
# 3. Auth → URL Configuration:
#    - Site URL: tu NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL
#    - Redirect URLs allowlist: agrega tu dominio + /reset-password + /accept-invite/**
#
# 4. Auth → SMTP Settings (opcional pero recomendado):
#    Configurar Resend/SendGrid para evitar el rate limit de 30 emails/hora.
#
# ============================================
# === Setup de Meta Developer (requerido una vez)
# ============================================
#
# 1. Crear app en developers.facebook.com
# 2. Agregar productos: WhatsApp, Messenger, Instagram
# 3. Webhook callbacks por canal:
#    - WhatsApp: ${NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/webhooks/whatsapp
#    - Facebook: ${NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/webhooks/facebook
#    - Instagram: ${NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/webhooks/instagram
# 4. Suscribirse a campos:
#    - WhatsApp Business: messages, message_deliveries, message_reads
#    - Page: messages, message_deliveries, message_reads
#    - Instagram: messages, message_deliveries, message_reads
# 5. App Settings → Basic → App Domains: tu dominio
# 6. Facebook Login → Valid OAuth Redirect URIs: ${NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/oauth/meta/callback
#
# ============================================
# === Verificación rápida después de setup
# ============================================
#
# 1. npm run typecheck  → 0 errores
# 2. npm run test       → 16 tests pasan
# 3. npm run build       → compila sin errores
# 4. Hacer deploy a Vercel con todas las env vars
# 5. Verificar que Vercel Cron funciona: /api/cron/poll-messages con Bearer CRON_SECRET
